    "updated_at": "2017-08-22T18:07:25Z",
    "body": "I have no objection to getting rid of these, assuming Gecko is willing to drop support.  I filed a bug to add use counters: https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1392710\r\n\r\nThere's a Chromium bug to support marquee events that's closed as wontfix: https://bugs.chromium.org/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=522326",
